stName|'there'} 👋</p>","id":"8e8c7861-4e57-41f4-ab28-90ccfcf9a0c0","settings":{"backgroundColor":"#ffffff","fontColor":"#16243d","hideElement":"no","includeInOutput":"both","padding":{"desktop":{"bottom":18,"left":32,"right":32,"top":0},"mobile":{"bottom":16,"left":20,"right":20,"top":0}},"rightToLeftTextDirection":false},"type":"text"},{"content":"\n                       <p style=\"font-family: Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 20px !important; line-height: 30px; color: #16243d; margin: 0\"><strong>I'm Teno, your coach at Fiteno — and I have just finished going through everything you told me.</strong></p>","id":"b4566d3b-6272-4a2e-819a-082da2e24a0f","settings":{"backgroundColor":"#ffffff","fontColor":"#16243d","hideElement":"no","includeInOutput":"both","padding":{"desktop":{"bottom":18,"left":32,"right":32,"top":0},"mobile":{"bottom":16,"left":20,"right":20,"top":0}},"rightToLeftTextDirection":false},"type":"text"},{"content":"\n                       <p style=\"color: #16243d; margin: 0; font-family: Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 20px !important; line-height: 30px\">Here is what you gave me to work with:</p>","id":"b17cefad-5ade-49d7-976b-830010582df6","settings":{"backgroundColor":"#ffffff","fontColor":"#16243d","hideElement":"no","includeInOutput":"both","padding":{"desktop":{"bottom":8,"left":32,"right":32,"top":0},"mobile":{"bottom":8,"left":20,"right":20,"top":0}},"rightToLeftTextDirection":false},"type":"text"},{"content":"\n                       <ul style=\"font-size: 20px !important; line-height: 30px; color: #16243D; margin: 0; padding-left: 24px; font-family: Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">\n                        <li style=\"color: #16243d; margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-size: 20px !important; line-height: 30px\">Your goal: a workout habit that survives a busy week</li>\n                        <li style=\"margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-size: 20px !important; line-height: 30px; color: #16243d\">Days you can train: 5 a week</li>\n                        <li style=\"color: #16243d; margin: 0; font-size: 20px !important; line-height: 30px\">Time you can protect: 15 minutes</li>\n                       </ul>","id":"827189b4-e64e-454a-bb45-3c59a423d209","settings":{"backgroundColor":"#ffffff","fontColor":"#16243d","hideElement":"no","includeInOutput":"both","padding":{"desktop":{"bottom":14,"left":32,"right":32,"top":0},"mobile":{"bottom":14,"left":20,"right":20,"top":0}},"rightToLeftTextDirection":false},"type":"text"},{"content":"\n                       <p style=\"line-height: 24px; color: #6b7280; margin: 0; font-family: Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 16px !important\">Something off in there? 👉 <a href=\"https://fiteno.app\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 16px !important; color: #FF5A3C; text-decoration: underline\">Redo your quiz</a> and I will rebuild the plan from scratch.</p>","id":"e2cf748c-b65b-4ef1-a35f-7546d4b0ee38","settings":{"backgroundColor":"#ffffff","fontColor":"#6b7280","hideElement":"no","includeInOutput":"both","padding":{"desktop":{"bottom":24,"left":32,"right":32,"top":0},"mobile":{"bottom":22,"left":20,"right":20,"top":0}},"rightToLeftTextDirection":false},"type":"text"},{"content":"\n                       <p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 20px !important; line-height: 30px; color: #16243d\">I put your answers against the five things that decide whether a habit actually sticks. This is your <strong>readiness snapshot</strong>:</p>","id":"103379d4-3f20-48f7-a6eb-12abf5f02dbe","settings":{"backgroundColor":"#ffffff","fontColor":"#16243d","hideElement":"no","includeInOutput":"both","padding":{"desktop":{"bottom":18,"left":32,"right":32,"top":0},"mobile":{"bottom":16,"left":20,"right":20,"top":0}},"rightToLeftTextDirection":false},"type":"text"},{"content":"\n                       <p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 20px !important; line-height: 32px; color: #16243d\">🟢 Drive to start: 9/10 — high<br>\n                         🟢 Time you can protect: 7/10 — enough for daily sessions<br>\n                         🟠 Weekly consistency: 5/10 — the real gap<br>\n                         🟠 Restarting after a miss: 5/10 — needs a plan that bends<br>\n                         🔴 Streak history: 3/10 — this is where we start</p>","id":"05d9897e-04e1-4c94-ab12-299dfbcd588e","settings":{"backgroundColor":"#ffffff","fontColor":"#16243d","hideElement":"no","includeInOutput":"both","padding":{"desktop":{"bottom":18,"left":32,"right":32,"top":0},"mobile":{"bottom":16,"left":20,"right":20,"top":0}},"rightToLeftTextDirection":false},"type":"text"},{"content":"\n                       <p style=\"font-family: Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 20px !important; line-height: 30px; color: #16243d; margin: 0\"><strong>Overall: 5.8/10 — and the two rows dragging it down are the two I can fix fastest.</strong></p>","id":"15fae17f-dae0-497c-bc17-08f8e54edd1d","settings":{"backgroundColor":"#ffffff","fontColor":"#16243d","hideElement":"no","includeInOutput":"both","padding":{"desktop":{"bottom":24,"left":32,"right":32,"top":0},"mobile":{"bottom":22,"left":20,"right":20,"top":0}},"rightToLeftTextDirection":false},"type":"text"},{"content":"\n                       <p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 20px !important; line-height: 30px; color: #16243d\">➡️ So it is already built. <strong><a href=\"https://fiteno.app/checkout/?email=%EMAIL%&uuid=%EXTERNAL_CUSTOMER_ID%\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 20px !important; color: #FF5A3C\">Week 1: five 15-minute sessions, no equipment needed</a></strong></p>","id":"9430f972-74c9-411a-9798-8471b3a0f9a0","settings":{"backgroundColor":"#ffffff","fontColor":"#16243d","hideElement":"no","includeInOutput":"both","padding":{"desktop":{"bottom":18,"left":32,"right":32,"top":0},"mobile":{"bottom":16,"left":20,"right":20,"top":0}},"rightToL